{"id":"be69e1c07e59dec4fc4ae7c928920641","text":"In the great fire of London in 1666 half of London was burnt down but only 6 people were injured.","source":"djtech.net","source_url":"https://www.djtech.net/humor/shorty_useless_facts.htm","language":"en","permalink":"https://uselessfacts.jsph.pl/api/v2/facts/be69e1c07e59dec4fc4ae7c928920641"}
